{"id":"dd7538c4feec93a6","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-pigeonhole-number.md","title":"Pseudointersection Number","display":"df-pigeonhole-number — Pseudointersection Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pigeonhole-number","aliases":["58-df-pigeonhole-number","Pseudointersection Number"],"display":"df-pigeonhole-number — Pseudointersection Number","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pigeonhole-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pigeonhole-number</span><span>Pseudointersection Number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pigeonhole-number — Pseudointersection Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak p,F,G,X\">\\(\\mathfrak p,F,G,X\\)</span> (pseudointersection parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PseudointersectionNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PseudointersectionNumber}_S\\)</span> (pseudointersection-number predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pigeonhole\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{PseudointersectionNumber}_S(\\mathfrak p)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak p)\\land\\mathfrak p=\\min\\left\\{|F|\\ \\middle|\\ F\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall G\\in[F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\;\\left|\\bigcap G\\right|=\\omega\\land\\neg\\exists X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\forall A\\in F\\;\\bigl(|X\\setminus A|&lt;\\omega\\bigr)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pigeonhole\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{PseudointersectionNumber}_S(\\mathfrak p)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak p)\\land\\mathfrak p=\\min\\left\\{|F|\\ \\middle|\\ F\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall G\\in[F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\;\\left|\\bigcap G\\right|=\\omega\\land\\neg\\exists X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\forall A\\in F\\;\\bigl(|X\\setminus A|&lt;\\omega\\bigr)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The historical filename is retained, but the concept is the pseudointersection number <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak p\">\\(\\mathfrak p\\)</span>, not a pigeonhole number.</li>\n<li>The finite-intersection condition excludes the empty subfamily and almost inclusion is expanded explicitly.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{p} \\leq \\mathfrak{t}\">\\(\\mathfrak{p} \\leq \\mathfrak{t}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{b} \\leq \\mathfrak{d}\">\\(\\mathfrak{b} \\leq \\mathfrak{d}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak p,F,G,X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PseudointersectionNumber}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pigeonhole\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{PseudointersectionNumber}_S(\\mathfrak p)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak p)\\land\\mathfrak p=\\min\\left\\{|F|\\ \\middle|\\ F\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall G\\in[F]^{<\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\;\\left|\\bigcap G\\right|=\\omega\\land\\neg\\exists X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\forall A\\in F\\;\\bigl(|X\\setminus A|<\\omega\\bigr)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{p} \\leq \\mathfrak{t}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{b} \\leq \\mathfrak{d}","display":false}],"bytes":1302,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-955","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-pigeonhole-number.md|58-df-pigeonhole-number]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}